      "text": "(\\sqrt{x} + \\sqrt{3})^2"
    },
    {
      "text": "= (\\sqrt{x})^2 + 2\\sqrt{x}\\sqrt{3} + (\\sqrt{3})^2"
    },
    {
      "text": "= x + 2\\sqrt{3x} + 3"
    },
    {
      "text": "x + 2\\sqrt{3x} + 3 − (x + 3)"
    },
    {
      "text": "= x + 2\\sqrt{3x} + 3 − x − 3"
    },
    {
      "text": "= 2\\sqrt{3x}"
    },
    {
      "text": "\\frac{2\\sqrt{3x}}{2}"
